{% extends "emails/base.njk" %}

{% block content %}
<h2>Your Advisory Session is Confirmed!</h2>

<p>Hi {{ name | default("Investor") }},</p>

<p>Your 1-on-1 portfolio review session with Arijit De has been scheduled and confirmed.</p>

<div class="info-box">
    <p><strong>Date & Time:</strong> {{ scheduledAt | date("MMMM d, yyyy 'at' h:mm a") }} (IST)</p>
    <p><strong>Duration:</strong> 45 minutes</p>
    <p><strong>Meeting Link:</strong> <a href="{{ meetLink }}">{{ meetLink }}</a></p>
</div>

<p><strong>What to prepare:</strong></p>
<ul>
    <li>Your mutual fund statements (CAS or consolidated statement)</li>
    <li>Your financial goals and risk tolerance</li>
    <li>Any specific questions you'd like to discuss</li>
</ul>

<p>Please join the meeting 5 minutes before the scheduled time. If you need to reschedule or cancel, please do so at least 24 hours in advance.</</p>

<div class="info-box">
    <p><strong>Need to reschedule?</strong> Reply to this email or visit your dashboard to reschedule or cancel.</</p>
</div>

<p>Looking forward to helping you optimize your portfolio!</p>

<p>Best regards,<br>
Arijit De<br>
Founder, FinAnalysis</p>
{% endblock %}